title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/clipboard:paste
catalog: GUI command
target: clipboard:paste
summary: Paste the file clipboard at a panel's file or folder, under its cursor (self / a panel type)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``c v`` → ``clipboard:paste self``
* ``ctrl+v`` → ``clipboard:paste self``
